<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- The panel's appearances (docs/features/07 UI-010, BL-132): the colours of each theme, and what
     a theme adds to the styles. A theme names every colour const of globals.xml; the first is
     globals.xml's own (what the LVGL Pro Editor shows). tools/lvpro_gen.py makes them a palette
     table that COLOR_* read, and ui_theme_apply() switches it at run time, in one step (UI-020).
     contrast="high" asks for the stricter targets of tools/ui_mockup.py's check (7:1 text, 3:1
     outlines); saver= names the theme whose colours the screen saver keeps, a dark photo in every
     appearance. Both mockups' viewers read this file (their Appearance switch). -->
